# API9 - Improper Inventory Management
# Detects requests to a deprecated API version by path match.
# Maps to OWASP API9, NIST CSF 2.0 DE.CM
#
# Validated 24 Sep 2026: /auth/v2/check-otp still responds alongside v3.
# No legitimate client has reason to call a retired endpoint, so a single
# request is sufficient grounds to alert.

index=main sourcetype=access_combined uri_path="*/api/auth/v2/*"
| stats count BY clientip, uri_path, status
